WEBVTT

NOTE Transcript of the narration

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.900
Meet BizOn. Simulation-based business learning,
designed in the Mekong Delta and built for the world.

2
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.600
Students, instructors, researchers and
institutions each have their own way in.

3
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.800
Start at Level 1 with Bến Phù Sa,
a riverside street-vendor start-up.

4
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.400
Run a company through six
decision rounds in Bật Nghiệp.

5
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.600
Then go global with Brand
Passport and Durian Passport.

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.400
Practise one skill at a time with IE
Lab, four practicum labs and the Arcade.

7
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.200
Every game has its own
trailer. Watch before you play.

8
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.205
The engine is deterministic
and explainable,

9
00:00:47.205 --> 00:00:51.100
so every result can be inspected,
discussed and reproduced.

10
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.300
From research, to decision, to evidence.

11
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.400
Start with Bến Phù Sa, at bizonland.com.
